<h2>What helps to have ready</h2>
<p>None of this is required, but it makes the first call more useful:</p>
<ul>
  <li>About when the house was built, if you know</li>
  <li>What's going on &mdash; backups, slow drains, water at a basement floor drain, a soft spot in the yard</li>
  <li>Whether it has happened before and what was done then</li>
  <li>Any sewer scope video or report you already have, such as one from a home inspection</li>
  <li>Where your cleanout is, if you've found one</li>
  <li>Which city or sanitation district sends your sewer bill</li>
</ul>

